WEBVTT - Big Buck Bunny (English Subtitles)

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[Upbeat orchestral music plays]

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.500
A sunny morning in the enchanted forest.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Big Buck Bunny steps out of his burrow to greet the day.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.500
Gentle butterflies flutter around the blooming wildflowers.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Bunny admires an apple hanging from the branch.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Suddenly, the mischievous forest rodents watch from the trees!

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Frank the flying squirrel plots a prank.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:02.000
An acorn is tossed, hitting the peaceful butterfly.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Bunny looks around in surprise, noticing the troublemakers.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:25.000
The chase begins across the forest clearing!

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Bunny prepares a clever plan to outsmart the bullies.
